      "created_at": "2013-03-16T23:55:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Redirecting, is it the same as dealing damage from a Rules as Written point of view? This has come up in a game while using Mr Fixer. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Driving Mantis style lets Mr Fixer redirect damage. Dual Crowbars lets him increase his damage and his an extra target when he \"<span class=\"bbcode-b\"><span class=\"bbcode-i\">deals</span></span>\" damage. So, in this example, if Fixer is dealt 2 damage, can he redirect that as 3 damage onto two different targets?</p>",
